          ],
          "block_id": 1,
          "block_order": 1
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "如：He was born on Monday，February18，1995.他生在1995年2月18日，星期一.)\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            282,
            554,
            1993,
            718
          ],
          "block_id": 2,
          "block_order": 2
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(4)(第一次使用)复数名词表示人或事物的类别时不用。如：Men are cleverer than monkeys.(人比猴聪明.)(5)三餐饭前不用\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            195,
            733,
            1593,
            923
          ],
          "block_id": 3,
          "block_order": 3
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "如：Men are cleverer than monkeys.(人比猴聪明.)(5)三餐饭前不用\n如: We have breakfast at home and lunch at school.\n(我们在家吃早饭，在枝吃午饭)\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            193,
            923,
            1562,
            1199
          ],
          "block_id": 4,
          "block_order": 4
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "(6)节、假日前一般不用.",
          "block_bbox": [
            189,
            1208,
            685,
            1285
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "如：On Children's Daythe boysoften get presents from their parents.(在儿童节，这些男孩经常得到父母的礼物)\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            276,
            1309,
